# import and langgraph ~23 MB, against a 512 MB tier already holding Django,
# a connection pool, the scan threads and — once a report is generated —
# fastembed's ~180 MB ONNX model. A web worker that has never produced a
# per-dependency report holds none of it. Measured in `docs/decisions.md` §8.9.
